{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3267e13b0e1899bab4ce8207b8644be3f00587f132ea51e262e865e1d65c1ab6", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\nそろそろ莉緒が着替え終わるはずだが……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。\n莉绪应该差不多换好衣服了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "78c50bf36146d3c1b9c0e305989b9306c2da4eea37f5fa14ff36b08c9bfc9ed5", "ja": "{$P$}くん、お・ま・た・せっ！\nねえ、見て！　この制服、すっごく素敵じゃない？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，久・等・啦！\n快看！这套制服，是不是特别棒？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "5cdf3ea93e1023514501a7366db5f0c334b3cb28a750ea745f16ac4b15afadf4", "ja": "こんなにカワイイ制服が着られるなら、\n会社員も悪くないかも……な～んて。ウフフ♪", "zh": "要是能穿上这么可爱的制服，当个上班族好像也不错嘛……什么的。嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "18f7a540897d43da88ffe697266175d98d22b3cc89617131eb24cadb175676bd", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}くんも、\nそう思わない？", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}先生，你也这么觉得吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1004_p", "source_sha256": "561f131def7446eb9a95e8ccc34321e4e4da6f61c8519fdfc9376e7171f522cf", "ja": "ああ、すごく似合ってるよ。でも、\n莉緒に会社員になられると困るかな……。", "zh": "嗯，非常适合你。不过，要是莉绪去当上班族，我可能会有点困扰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "14807ea31efbe38f9a7e62b202748d61af8a9346faa3c2f20a3cc9cca5a2ca46", "ja": "ウフフ、心配してくれてるの？　大丈夫よ、\n私は{$P$}くんのアイドルだから♪", "zh": "呵呵，你是在担心我吗？没事的，\n因为我是{$P$}的偶像嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "2889f0968897c5573d87143c1669d94658ec1fe33f5ea122d55103bfbe533ad7", "ja": "けど、せっかくこんなにカワイイ制服なんですもの。\nグラビア撮影だけじゃ、もったいないわよねぇ……。", "zh": "不过，这么可爱的制服，不能只用来拍写真，未免太浪费了，对吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "db42bd8b4f5e502fa11683017d23c4918723f7f6e49d0b0e6a845b4e2cbbaa1c", "ja": "他のみんなの衣装もあることだし……\nこの衣装で、ドラマなんてどうかしら！？", "zh": "既然还有其他人的服装……\n要不要就穿这套服装去演电视剧呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1008_p", "source_sha256": "294a9f1272e77e3c4175f32b22b2246e33ebc01e2ae50ec97fe74ed72d94cd33", "ja": "社会人のドラマなら、莉緒も歌織さんや風花達と\n『セレブレーション！』に出演したじゃないか。", "zh": "要说职场剧的话，莉緒不是已经和歌织她们、风花她们一起出演过『Celebration!』了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "1b26ec690364fb86ee5edd514eec60814198ad86f9f29a23e984cafbf9394cca", "ja": "もう、それはそれ、これはこれよ！\nせっかくなんだから、新しい衣装で出たいじゃない♪", "zh": "真是的，那是那回事，这是这回事嘛！\n难得有这个机会，我想穿新衣服登场嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "33d3c9f858e66b8b8fe477a5b5616d0dd4eccc631dfbda0a36ab11bf26e7a9f3", "ja": "ねえねえ{$P$}くん、何かないの？\nそういう話～。", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}，就没有什么办法吗？就是那种事啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fa50317e2af642fbeb127157ed982f96812233cf4e18069f8e5916eb60c0bf22", "ja": "わかった。じゃあ今回の撮影が終わったら、\n営業かけてみよう。", "zh": "我知道了。那等这次的拍摄结束后，\n我去跑跑业务试试看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "79cee28d5d0393801be71b21a13ef298e9646ec6b49c7862190ae683d3cdf03b", "ja": "ホント！？　ありがと～！\nウフフ、がんばらなくっちゃね♪", "zh": "真的！？谢谢你～！\n呵呵，我可得加油了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1013_p", "source_sha256": "95b6e2d2db6b5fd209718dede269ff70ba83d0451f293ee1a0cc9d40699535f3", "ja": "それにしても、今回はずいぶんやる気なんだな。\n何か、理由でもあるのか？", "zh": "话说回来，这次你还真是干劲十足啊。\n是有什么特别的理由吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "0cc5583081566cc8429cd4ab2e79d928e048b8d8768e84ce21bc7e43f9d792a6", "ja": "やる気っていうか……今朝、見かけちゃったのよね。\n暗ーい顔して通勤してる、サラリーマンの男の子……。", "zh": "倒也不是干劲十足啦……其实我今天早上看见了哦。\n一个一脸阴沉地去上班的年轻上班族……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "2c243d15dcb16186007058ed1356ea64b74888495f8ee3f801de6fbbcde2c383", "ja": "私も、お仕事に行き詰まってた時はそうだったから。\nあの男の子の気持ちが、何となくわかる気がしたの。", "zh": "我以前工作遇到瓶颈的时候，也是那个样子。所以，我好像能隐约理解那个男孩子的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0bac416ed38d70c52c2d3cfd36ea295cc3703ae91948a65173af0f09ddf43da0", "ja": "莉緒……。", "zh": "莉绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "ed2eaec6d2b07a6409695aa65db143f4e034dec23aafbf5a927cfc2e2cf6e986", "ja": "だからここは、私が一肌脱ぐしかない！と思って。\nグラビアのお仕事も、もちろんきっちりやるけど……。", "zh": "所以我觉得，这里只能由我来出马了！\n写真拍摄的工作，我当然也会好好完成……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "0155725de947b82b15a74fec0d5f0a6eecd2592515ae1c4934ddec68a1d4adc2", "ja": "ドラマなら、もっと大勢の人に届くんじゃないかしら？\nこれも、アイドルだけにできる、素敵なお仕事でしょ♪", "zh": "如果是电视剧的话，不是能传达给更多人吗？\n这也是只有偶像才能做的美好工作吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1019_p", "source_sha256": "dbab4d2ff5de922903e96c31aaf57b672bf88723da530b58a4500369716323d6", "ja": "なるほど……そういう事か。\nわかった、そういう事なら企画から相談してみよう。", "zh": "原来如此……是这么回事啊。\n明白了，既然这样，那就从企划开始商量看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "3ad1a15116169d25066febae6918d3d03efbb674262f8fab26786c8762b070c9", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}くん！\n頼りにしてるわ、ウフフ♪", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}！\n我可就指望你了，嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0173_1021_p", "source_sha256": "09a7dd6d354c564a8456cc16b3e3a49005fa29b553004043b7cbb3e812480cde", "ja": "（莉緒のサービス精神は、優しさから来るものだ。\n……さて、俺も新しい企画を考えないとな！）", "zh": "（莉绪这种乐于服务他人的精神，源自她的温柔。……好了，我也得想个新企划了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
